      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Create your first real invoice</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto">
        <% if (firstRealInvoicePrompt.hasSeed) { %>
          The sample below shows what a finished invoice looks like — open it to explore, or jump straight in with a real client now.
        <% } else { %>
          A professional invoice in under 60 seconds. Email it, print it as a PDF, or share a Stripe pay link — all from one screen.
        <% } %>
      </p>
      <a
        href="/invoices/quick"
        data-testid="first-real-invoice-prompt-cta"
        class="bg-brand-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-brand-700 transition inline-block"
      >
        Create a new invoice &rarr;
